--- the prose a specification carries for its document ---
# Store

What the store exposes.

The store keeps one entry per key. Nothing here says how it is stored.

## Store.open

Open the store.

`Store.open(path)`

### Example

Opening twice answers the same store.

```ruby
store = Store.open(path)
store.read(key)
```
